tRate":"1","currencyPrice":0.0647,"currencySymbol":"$","isForeignDiscount":null,"ladderLevel":null}],"productImages":["https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20260525_HRS-U-FL-R-SMT-1-80_C88374_front.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20260525_HRS-U-FL-R-SMT-1-80_C88374_back.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20260525_HRS-U-FL-R-SMT-1-80_C88374_blank.jpg"],"edaSvgInfo":{"schSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/4d7c12ca718321ff6a90feefa27cbc35.svg?t=1742924700","pcbSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/d9e584f6887044aca7dbb1f2a1f3f90c.svg?t=1742924700"},"faqs":[{"question":"What are the maximum rated signal frequencies and impedance characteristics of the U.FL-R-SMT-1(80) connector?","answer":"The Hirose U.FL-R-SMT-1(80) is a surface-mount, male-pin micro-coaxial receptacle designed for RF applications with a frequency range from DC to 6GHz. It has a nominal characteristic impedance of 50Ω. Depending on the mating cable assembly, the VSWR is 1.3 maximum up to 3GHz and ranges from 1.3 to 1.5 maximum between 3GHz and 6GHz, helping maintain reliable RF signal transmission."},{"question":"What are the physical dimensions and mounting characteristics of the U.FL-R-SMT-1(80)?","answer":"The U.FL-R-SMT-1(80) occupies a compact 7.7mm² PCB mounting area and weighs approximately 15.7mg. When mated with compatible plugs, the connector provides nominal mated heights of 1.9mm, 2.3mm, or 2.4mm, depending on the selected cable assembly."},{"question":"What materials and plating are used in the construction of the U.FL-R-SMT-1(80)?","answer":"The receptacle features a phosphor bronze shell with silver plating, a brass male center contact with gold plating, and an LCP (Liquid Crystal Polymer) insulator rated UL94V-0. The connector is specified for 30 mating and unmating cycles with the corresponding plug."},{"question":"What are the electrical and environmental specifications of the U.FL-R-SMT-1(80)?","answer":"The connector has a maximum center contact resistance of 20mΩ and outer contact resistance of 10mΩ. It provides an insulation resistance of at least 500MΩ at 100V DC and withstands 200V AC for one minute. The operating temperature range is −40°C to +90°C, with an operating humidity of 90% RH maximum."},{"question":"What packaging options support automated SMT assembly for the U.FL-R-SMT-1(80)?","answer":"The U.FL-R-SMT-1(80) is supplied in embossed carrier tape with a 4mm pitch for automated pick-and-place assembly, while the U.FL-R-SMT-1(60) version uses an 8mm pitch. The receptacles are packaged on φ330mm reels containing 10,000 pieces and are designed for automatic placement using standard vacuum nozzles."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/ade8681cf25347ad817fa65440db6a2c.pdf?productCode=C88374","authenticationList":["ROHS3 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS3","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1573865","fileName":"如文件列表_ROHS认证(中文版)_HRS(广濑).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/632ec37a5510a16c7265455a1442a989.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1957322","fileName":"原材料适用_全量通用_ROHS认证_HRS(广濑).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/9489bfe3c08d0c749797e9276c433baa.zip"}],"productDescEn":"Connector Receptacle IPEX Male Pin 50Ω Surface Mount","productIntroEn":"Connector Receptacle IPEX Male Pin 50Ω Surface Mount","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_14432_s","paramName":"频率","paramNameEn":"Frequency range","paramValue":"6GHz","paramValueEn":"6GHz","paramValueEnForSearch":null,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":21},{"paramCode":"param_13551","paramName":"连接器类型","paramNameEn":"Connector Type","paramValue":"板端;内针","paramValueEn":"Board Side;Inner pin","paramValueEnForSearch":null,"isMain":null,"sortNumber":1,"sort":1},{"paramCode":"param_14723_s","paramName":"工作温度","paramNameEn":"Operating Temperature","paramValue":"-40℃~+90℃","paramValueEn":"-40℃~+90℃","paramValueEnForSearch":null,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":16},{"paramCode":"param_135